.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH wx-alerts 1  "alerts " 
.SH NAME
wx\-alerts \- Active National Weather Service alerts (US only)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwx alerts\fR [\fB\-\-only\-if\-any\fR] [\fB\-\-say\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-\-node\fR] [\fB\-l\fR|\fB\-\-to\-links\fR] [\fB\-a\fR|\fB\-\-audio\-format\fR] [\fB\-w\fR|\fB\-\-wait\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-voice\fR] [\fB\-g\fR|\fB\-\-gain\fR] [\fB\-\-api\-key\-file\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPLACE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Active National Weather Service alerts (US only)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-only\-if\-any\fR
Announce nothing when no alerts are in effect, instead of saying so
.TP
\fB\-\-say\fR
Speak the announcement on this machine
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-out\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Write the announcement as audio to FILE, in the format its extension names
.TP
\fB\-\-node\fR \fI<NODE>\fR
Play the announcement on this AllStar node
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-to\-links\fR
With \-\-node: send it to linked nodes too, not only the node\*(Aqs own transmitter
.TP
\fB\-a\fR, \fB\-\-audio\-format\fR \fI<AUDIO_FORMAT>\fR
Audio format [default: from the file\*(Aqs extension with \-\-out, sln16 with \-\-node]
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
mp3: MP3 format
.IP \(bu 2
wav: WAV format (uncompressed)
.IP \(bu 2
ogg: OGG format
.IP \(bu 2
ulaw: ULAW format (8\-bit G.711)
.IP \(bu 2
alaw: ALAW format (8\-bit G.711)
.IP \(bu 2
gsm: GSM format (telephony)
.IP \(bu 2
sln16: Raw 16\-bit signed linear at 16 kHz, for Asterisk to convert as each channel needs
.RE
.TP
\fB\-w\fR, \fB\-\-wait\fR \fI<WAIT>\fR [default: 60]
With \-\-node: seconds the node gets to open the audio file before it is deleted
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-voice\fR \fI<VOICE>\fR [default: en\-US\-Chirp3\-HD\-Leda]
A Google voice name, or espeak
.TP
\fB\-g\fR, \fB\-\-gain\fR \fI<GAIN>\fR
Google volume gain in dB, \-96 to 16 [default: 6]
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-key\-file\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
File holding the Google API key [default: $GOOGLE_CLOUD_API_KEY, else ~/.config/weather\-rs/google\-api\-key]
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIPLACE\fR>
A station (KSJC), latitude,longitude, NWS grid square (MTR 99,82) or zone (CAZ513), US street address or place name ("Mountain View, CA"); quotes are optional
